OL,3,AI won't accept exclusion, says Polanski
OL,4,Aafter criticism of Zionist motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski has said he will not
OL,7,Faccept anyone being excluded from the
OL,8,FGreen Party "because of the religious
OL,9,For communal body they are part of",
OL,10,Fafter members adopted a motion
OL,11,Fdeclaring Zionism a form of racism.
OL,13,FThe Green leader said "no-one will be
OL,14,Fmade unwelcome because of their
OL,15,Fbackground, their faith, or where they
OL,16,Fworship".
OL,18,FThe motion defines Zionism as an
OL,19,Fideology supporting "an
OL,20,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" and
OL,21,Fbacks a "single democratic Palestinian
OL,22,Fstate in all of historic Palestine".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
